sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Teleop/Nav
    participant Vel as VelocityConverter
    participant Cmd as CommandMapper
    participant CAN as CANopen Handler
    participant Bus as CAN Bus
    participant Drv as Motor Driver
    
    Note over Vel,Cmd: Initialization Phase
    Cmd->>CAN: Load EDS & Config
    CAN->>Bus: NMT Start Remote Node
    CAN->>Bus: Configure PDOs
    
    Note over App,Drv: Runtime Operation
    App->>Vel: Twist(linear, angular)
    Vel->>Cmd: wheel_left_vel, wheel_right_vel
    Cmd->>CAN: writeObject(target_velocity)
    CAN->>Bus: RPDO Frame
    Bus->>Drv: CAN Message
    
    Drv->>Bus: TPDO Frame (status, position, velocity)
    Bus->>CAN: Receive Frame
    CAN->>Cmd: Update Object Dictionary
    Cmd->>App: Publish JointState, Status